# `pnpm --silent run release:notes <version>` writes here for `gh release create --notes-file`.
release-notes.md
# `claude plugin eval` writes each run's report and JSON here; results are summarised in docs/evaluations/.
plugins/*/evals/results/
# Claude Code creates worktrees here; https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees: "Add `.claude/worktrees/` to your `.gitignore` so worktree contents don't appear as untracked files in your main checkout."
.claude/worktrees/
